      "writtenOn": "2021-07-22T23:38:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the explanation.\n\nI assume 1631 reads 16:31? Then, I would vote on truncating time. That is, we\u0027ll get guybrush_13983.0.2021_05_20. It\u0027s hard to remember what\u0027s in a build made a year ago than what\u0027s in a build made a few hours ago.",
      "parentUuid": "97d88e10_51eee376",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
