      "writtenOn": "2021-07-26T23:43:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Latest patch generates \"guybrush_13983.0.21_05_20\", the year is also abbreviated. \n\nWe need a way to identify when then non-active image copy does not include FWID so we don\u0027t attempt to read it. I added a 4 byte cookie3, but there may be better ways to handle this. It would have been best if image_data had a structure version embedded from the beginning. Another option would be to tweak cookie1/2 but I\u0027m not sure if tools external to the EC are keying on these cookies.",
